REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# SMX MESH VESICLE LIFE MI2382: ATP5F1D ATP synthase F1 subunit delta after ATP5F1A on OXPHOS continuum
# Continuum ...->acsl1->cpt1a->slc25a20->cpt2->acadvl->hadha->etfdh->uqcrc1->cycs->cox4i1->atp5f1a->atp5f1d (ATP5F1D after COX4I1 CV F1 delta limb)
# Gift: ATP5F1D seats F1 delta under ASSERT so PMF from COX4I1 drives ADP+Pi to ATP and free energy couples without hollow Complex-V lock (CV F1 delta ward).
# Domain: inner-membrane Complex V F1 ATP5F1D ward (Complex V F1 delta central-stalk couple limb of oxidative phosphorylation after CIV).
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow. Not a dual ladder.

ENTITY mesh OF Cell 1 55 0
ENTITY cargo OF Cell 1 36 0
ENTITY lysed OF Cell 0 12 0

SEND mesh set_threshold 9
SEND cargo set_threshold 11

